    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Business Questions - Part 1'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='813' maxwidth='1350' minheight='813' minwidth='1350' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='68266' id='3' type-v2='text' w='94074' x='2963' y='4920'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='28'>Story 1 – What drives default? </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='28'>Business questions</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q1. Where and when does Bondora lend?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q2. How does default differ by risk rating?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q3. Which countries have the highest default rates?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q4. Does a borrower’s income affect default?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q5. Do loan amount and loan duration matter?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q6. Does a higher interest rate mean more default?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q7. How do defaulted loans differ from non-defaulted loans?</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>Q8. Which rating × duration combinations are the riskiest?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
