          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='35178' id='70' type-v2='text' w='28889' x='68222' y='60271'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>How to read this chart</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'>• Dot</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'> right of the line</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'> = higher risk than the reference</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'>• Dot </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'>left of the line</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'> = lower risk</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'>References:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='12'> Denmark and rating A</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>Red = cancelled more often than Denmark / rating A. Teal = less often.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='32226' id='71' type-v2='text' w='63704' x='3185' y='63592'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Rating is the strongest driver:</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> the odds of default climb step by step from AA (0.54×) to G (3.38×) compared with rating A.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Country matters a lot:</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> Estonia (0.10×), Netherlands (0.16×) and Finland (0.17×) have much lower odds than Denmark. Latvia (0.38×) and Spain (0.84×) are closer.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'>Loan terms:</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='11'> a larger amount (1.26×), longer duration (1.22×) and higher interest rate (1.14×) raise the risk. Higher income (0.79×) lowers it.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
