          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1d2b3a' fontsize='24'>41%</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='11'>of loans flagged for review</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14760' id='120' type-v2='text' w='28889' x='68148' y='41205'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c0392b' fontsize='24'>14.9%</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='11'>of flagged loans default (avg 9.1%)  </run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='7'>Æ      </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='31119' id='123' type-v2='text' w='63704' x='2889' y='65806'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>At cut-off 0.5</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> the model flags 41% of loans and catches 68% of all defaults. 14.9% of flagged loans default, 1.6× the average of 9.1%.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Lower cut-off (0.3):</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> 93% of defaults caught, but 77% of loans flagged. Almost every loan needs review.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Higher cut-off (0.7):</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> only 5% flagged and 30% of those default, but 83% of defaults are missed.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' italic='true'>The cut-off is a business choice: the cost of a missed default vs the cost of reviewing a good loan</run>
            <run fontsize='11' italic='true'>.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='31242' id='126' type-v2='text' w='28889' x='68148' y='65806'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>How to read this chart</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>•</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> Teal line:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> share of all defaults caught
• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Red line:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> share of flagged loans that default
• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Grey line:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> our cut-off 0.5</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Moving it left catches more defaults but flags more good loans.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
