    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Q2. Rating'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='813' maxwidth='1350' minheight='813' minwidth='1350' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <datasources>
        <datasource caption='fct_loans (analytics.fct_loans) (bondora)' name='federated.0f74fq21v5mqo31e68qhj0n978rs' />
      </datasources>
      <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0f74fq21v5mqo31e68qhj0n978rs'>
        <column caption='Country' datatype='string' name='[country]' role='dimension' semantic-role='[Country].[ISO3166_2]' type='nominal' />
        <column caption='Issued Year' datatype='integer' name='[issued_year]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
        <column-instance column='[country]' derivation='None' name='[none:country:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column-instance column='[issued_year]' derivation='None' name='[none:issued_year:ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
        <column-instance column='[rating_group]' derivation='None' name='[none:rating_group:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
        <column caption='Rating Group' datatype='string' name='[rating_group]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
      </datasource-dependencies>
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6150' id='3' type-v2='text' w='94074' x='2963' y='1845'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='24'>Q2. How does default differ by risk rating?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3690' id='14' type-v2='text' w='22222' x='51111' y='60886'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='14'>Filter the charts</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='40590' id='15' type-v2='text' w='45926' x='2963' y='60886'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Default rises steadily from 5.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>5% (AA) t</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>o 26</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>.5% (G). </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>The rating is the clearest risk driver.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• F- and G-rated loans default almost 5× m</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>ore tha</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>n AA loans.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Weak ratings + medium/long loans are the riskiest: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>G 13–36 months = 29.7%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>, </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>F 37–60 months = 27.6%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='7'>W</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone h='49200' id='18' name='Rating (live)' w='45926' x='2963' y='9225'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
