                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Default falls as income rises: 19.6% under 1,500 EUR vs 10.1% above 3,500 EUR</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Borrowers earning under 1,500 EUR carry about 2× the risk of high earners</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Defaulted borrowers earn less on average: 2,302 vs 2,593 EUR per month</run>
