                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Default rises with the interest rate: 9.</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>3% u</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>nder 15% vs 24</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>.7% a</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>t 25%+</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• A rate of 25% </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>or more is </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>a clear warning sign: about 2.5×</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> the risk</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Most loans (</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>69%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>) have a rate of 15–19.9%; only </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>8%</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> are at 25%+, so the warning sign affects a small group</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
