          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='22'>Q7. How do defaulted loans differ from non-defaulted loans?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='30873' id='15' type-v2='text' w='45926' x='2963' y='58426'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Lower income: 2,302 </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>vs 2,593 EUR </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>per month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Larger amount: 2,236 v</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>s 1,943 EUR</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Higher interest: 19.6% v</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>s 18.0%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Slight</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>ly longer: 61 vs 58 </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>months</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>All four risk drivers point in the same direction.</run>
