                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='28659' id='15' type-v2='text' w='45926' x='1926' y='68881'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Key findings</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Weak ratings + medium/long loans are the riskiest: G 13–36 months = 29.7%, F 37–60 months = 27.6%</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Latvia: even A-rated loans default about 30%, so the rating alone isn’t enough there</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>• Short loans (up to 12 months) stay low-risk in almost every rating</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{3EFA0B80-EE21-4001-8CB7-2889A299ABB5}' />
    </dashboard>
    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Q9. Can we predict'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='813' maxwidth='1350' minheight='813' minwidth='1350' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6150' id='3' type-v2='text' w='94074' x='2963' y='1845'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='24'>Q9. Can we tell, on the day a loan is issued, who will default?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='49200' id='5' type-v2='text' w='45926' x='2963' y='9225'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>How the model works</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Goal:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> predict two yes/no outcomes for each loan: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>default within 12 months</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> (9.1% of loans) and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>cancellation</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> (4.1%)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Inputs (known on the day of issue):</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> income, loan amount, interest rate, duration, country, risk rating</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Not used:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> principal debt, months in default, loan status. These are only known after a default, so using them would be leakage.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Method:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> multiple logistic regression → a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>risk score from 0 to 1</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> for every loan</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Data:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> trained on </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>308,319</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> loans, tested on </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>77,080</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'> loans it had never seen</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Linear regression was tried first, but it gave impossible negative probabilities.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f3f5f8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23370' id='6' type-v2='text' w='22222' x='51111' y='9225'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='28'>0.70</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='11'>AUC: the model ranks loans fairly well</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23370' id='7' type-v2='text' w='22222' x='74815' y='9225'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='28'>68% </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='11'>of defaults caught at cut-off 0.5</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23370' id='8' type-v2='text' w='22222' x='51111' y='35055'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='28'>14× </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='11'>riskiest vs safest 10% of loans</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='23370' id='9' type-v2='text' w='22222' x='74815' y='35055'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='22'>0.704 ± 0.002 </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='11'>5-fold cross-validation: stable results</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='34932' id='10' type-v2='text' w='94074' x='2963' y='60886'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='16'>Answer: partly yes.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>• The model separates risky from safe loans: the riskiest 10% default </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>24.5%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>, the safest 10% only </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>1.7%</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>• AUC </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>0.70 </run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>= fair, not strong. It is good enough to screen and prioritise loans for review, but not to approve or reject automatically</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>• The results are stable (</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'>0.704 ± 0.002</run>
            <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='14'> across 5 test splits), so the model is not just lucky on one sample</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
