    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Recommendations'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='813' maxwidth='1350' minheight='813' minwidth='1350' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='margin' value='0' />
            <format attr='padding' value='16' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6150' id='3' type-v2='text' w='94074' x='2963' y='1845'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='24'>Recommendations: what should lenders and investors do?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='64453' id='161' type-v2='text' w='30370' x='2963' y='11685'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>1 Before approval</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='11' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Based  on the risk drivers</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Check F/G-rated and unrated loans more strictly.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>They default 2–5× more often than AA loans.</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Extra attention for income under 1,500 EUR</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>. </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>19.6% of these loans default.</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Treat an interest rate of 25%+ as a warning sign.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>24.7% default.</run>
            <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Watch 37–60-month loans and amounts of 2,000–4,999 EUR</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>more closely.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
            <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='8' />
            <format attr='padding' value='12' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#f4f7f9' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='64576' id='162' type-v2='text' w='30370' x='34815' y='11685'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>2 Use the model</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Based on the predicting default</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>• Score every new loan at issue.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> Flag loans with a score above 0.5 for review: this catches 68% of defaults.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Set the cut-off to fit the team’s capacity.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>0.3 catches 93% but flags 77% of loans; 0.7 flags only 5%.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>• </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Start a watch list now.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'> 3,131 young 2025 loans are already in the riskiest group: check their payments every month.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#d5dde5' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
