        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='64576' id='163' type-v2='text' w='30370' x='66667' y='11685'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18'>3 Countries </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='11' italic='true'>Based on the Default and Cancellations</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>• Review lending in Spain, Latvia and Denmark</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>Default is very high there, but volumes are small.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>• Keep rating and country at the centre of approval</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>A G-rated loan has 3.4× the odds of default of an A loan.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>• Plan for more cancellations in Estonia, Latvia and Finland </run>
