                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6150' id='3' type-v2='text' w='94074' x='2963' y='1845'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='24'>Recommendations: what should lenders and investors do?</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='64453' id='161' type-v2='text' w='30370' x='2963' y='11685'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f6f8b' fontsize='18' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>1 Before approval</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#5b6b7b' fontsize='11' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Based  on the risk drivers</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Check F/G-rated and unrated loans more strictly.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>They default 2–5× more often than AA loans.</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Extra attention for income under 1,500 EUR</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>. </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>19.6% of these loans default.</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• Treat an interest rate of 25%+ as a warning sign.</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>24.7% default.</run>
                    <run lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>• </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Watch 37–60-month loans and amounts of 2,000–4,999 EUR</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>more closely.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
